You are helping build a personal portfolio for Nikolai Martino (Media Design, IED Roma).

## Stack
- Static HTML/CSS/JS, Italian, no frameworks
- css/style.css, js/main.js, img/

## Design (Orveka / Mono Agency inspired)
- Monochrome editorial: --bg #FAFAFA, --fg #141414, --black #000
- Font: Inter 300/400/500 (light headlines)
- Fullscreen overlay nav (logo left + hamburger)
- Full-bleed dark hero with typing headline + white pill CTA
- Two-column portfolio grid, black “Why” bento, process list, FAQ accordion
- App screens: .phone-rail with no decorative backgrounds
- Soft scroll reveals; keep phone lightbox

## Content
- Projects: Coca-Cola × MFW, Leonardo, Photoshop, Illustrator, Video, Liceo
- Tone: premium, concise, editorial
